{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quem, an adventurer, is the first person to step foot in the dungeon, &quot;Heaven's Ladder&quot;, in over 500 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not long after she does so, a strange shadowy monster casts some sort of curse on her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Come deep\u2015\u2015into\u2015\u2015this place\u2015\u2015I shall await you at\u2015\u2015the highest spot\u2015\u2015&quot;, the apparition says before vanishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to break the curse, Quem teams up with the adventurer Vise to explore the dungeon and to uncover the meaning behind those mysterious words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Classic Style Action RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an Ancient Dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch Between Melee and Ranged Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subquest System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Enhancing System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay Cleared Dungeons</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1078280?t=1749383605","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749383605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749383605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749383605","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Ruins Seeker contains strong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quem, an adventurer, is the first person to step foot in the dungeon, &quot;Heaven's Ladder&quot;, in over 500 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not long after she does so, a strange shadowy monster casts some sort of curse on her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Come deep\u2015\u2015into\u2015\u2015this place\u2015\u2015I shall await you at\u2015\u2015the highest spot\u2015\u2015&quot;, the apparition says before vanishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to break the curse, Quem teams up with the adventurer Vise to explore the dungeon and to uncover the meaning behind those mysterious words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Classic Style Action RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an Ancient Dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch Between Melee and Ranged Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subquest System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Enhancing System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay Cleared Dungeons</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nupuryu no sato"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078280/header.jpg?t=1749383605","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Kagura Games and Nupuryu no sato, All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1078280/287878/162b7b4157381365256501447e2543a9f315a607/1751185424/dash_av1.mpd?t=1590323721","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1078280/287878/162b7b4157381365256501447e2543a9f315a607/1751185424/dash_h264.mpd?t